error[E0277]: the steps of a workflow are all synchronous or all asynchronous
  --> tests/ui/workflow/steps_of_both_modes.rs:29:13
   |
29 | #[with_step(Dispatch, name = "dispatch")]
   |             ^^^^^^^^ a step of another mode than the workflow's first step
   |
   = help: the trait `__ItineraSameMode<Synchronous>` is not implemented for `Asynchronous`
   = note: a workflow takes its mode from its first step: it is asynchronous when that step's `run` is an `async fn`, and every other step shares that mode
